        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "D. Vacation time will be available for schedule and use, but vested over 10 months. Terminated Employees, except those who have 8 years of service, retire under the UFCW National Pension Plan, or terminate due to disability or death will be paid only for vested time. Any vacation time paid in excess of the vested amount will be repaid. The Employee's final pay will be subject to withholding as full or partial repayment.",
